IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `igc-rules`

-- Immigration (Guardianship of Children) Act 1946 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

-- A child born 1 March 2012, asked about on 1 January 2026.
GIVEN comp IS A `Companion`, act IS A `My act`, excuse IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Child case`
`a child arriving with` comp `while I` act `excused` excuse MEANS
    `Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 1 2026, TRUE, comp, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, act, excuse, JUST (Date 1 2 2026), JUST (Date 10 2 2026)

`alone` MEANS `a child arriving with` `no one` `while I` `none of these` `excused` FALSE

-- s 4AAA
#ASSERT `the child is a non-citizen child` `alone`
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`a child arriving with` `a parent` `while I` `none of these` `excused` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`a child arriving with` `a relative aged 21 or over, other than a parent` `while I` `none of these` `excused` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`a child arriving with` `an intending adoptive parent` `while I` `none of these` `excused` FALSE))
#ASSERT `the child is a non-citizen child` (`a child arriving with` `another adult aged 21 or over` `while I` `none of these` `excused` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 1 2026, TRUE, `another adult aged 21 or over`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))
-- s 4AAA(4): a relative's ward by direction
#ASSERT `the child is a non-citizen child` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 1 2026, TRUE, `a relative aged 21 or over, other than a parent`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING)
-- 18 on 1 March 2030
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 3 2030, TRUE, `no one`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))
#ASSERT `the child is a non-citizen child` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 28 2 2030, TRUE, `no one`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`the child position for` `alone`)'s `the guardianship ends at the latest on` EQUALS Date 1 3 2030
-- s 6, s 11
#ASSERT NOT (`the Minister is guardian` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 1 2026, TRUE, `no one`, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))
#ASSERT NOT (`the child is a non-citizen child` (`Child case` OF TRUE, Date 1 3 2012, Date 1 1 2026, TRUE, `no one`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, `none of these`, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING))
-- ss 6A, 9
#ASSERT `I commit an offence` (`a child arriving with` `no one` `while I` `help the child leave Australia without the Minister's consent` `excused` TRUE)
#ASSERT `I commit an offence` (`a child arriving with` `no one` `while I` `knowingly harbour or conceal the child from the custodian` `excused` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`a child arriving with` `no one` `while I` `remove or entice the child from the custodian` `excused` TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`a child arriving with` `a parent` `while I` `remove or entice the child from the custodian` `excused` FALSE))
-- s 11A
#ASSERT `the last request day for` `alone` EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT `the last reconsideration day for` `alone` EQUALS JUST (Date 27 3 2026)
